    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_bbteacher_21",
      "hash64": "FA2CABC9DB98E7B2",
      "text": "那麼就決定了！\\n很可惜杜若不參加，\\r\\n但就由我、[VAR 0x0100(0000)]、丹瑜，\\r\\n以及烏栗，共４個人前往調查。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
